etastasis of colon cancer, identified by genome-wide cDNA microarray</article-title>. <source>Int J Oncol</source><volume>24</volume>: <fpage>305</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>312</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14719106</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0048547-Frederiksen1"><label>8</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Frederiksen</surname><given-names>CM</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Knudsen</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Laurberg</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name>, <name><surname>&#x000d8;rntoft</surname><given-names>TF</given-names></name> (<year>2003</year>) <article-title>Classification of Dukes' B and C colorectal cancers using expression arrays</article-title>. <source>J Cancer Res Clin Oncol</source><volume>129</volume>: <fpage>263</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>271</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12750996</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0048547-BirkenkampDemtroder2"><label>9</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Birkenkamp-Demtroder</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Olesen</surname><given-names>SH</given-names></name>, <name><surname>S&#x000f8;rensen</surname><given-names>FB</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Laurberg</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Laiho</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name>, <etal>et al</etal> (<year>2005</year>) <article-title>Differential gene expression in colon cancer of the caecum versus the sigmoid and rectosigmoid</article-title>. <source>Gut</source><volume>54</volume>: <fpage>374</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>384</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15710986</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0048547-Chiu1"><label>10</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Chiu</surname><given-names>ST</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Hsieh</surname><given-names>FJ</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Chen</surname><given-names>SW</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Chen</surname><given-names>CL</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Shu</surname><given-names>HF</given-names></name>, <etal>et al</etal> (<year>2005</year>) <article-title>Clinicopathologic correlation of up-regulated genes identified using cDNA microarray and real-time reverse transcription-PCR in human colorectal cancer</article-title>. <source>Cancer Epidemiol Biomarkers Prev</source><volume>14</volume>: <fpage>437</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>443</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15734970</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0048547-Wang1"><label>11</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Wang</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Jatkoe</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Zhang</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Mutch</surname><given-names>MG</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Talantov</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name> (<year>2004</year>) <article-title>Gene expression profiles and molecular markers to predict recurrence of Dukes' B colon cancer</article-title>. <source>J Clin Oncol</source><volume>22</volume>: <fpage>1564</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>1571</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15051756</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0048547-Galamb1"><label>12</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Galamb</surname><given-names>O</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Gy&#x000f6;rffy</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Sipos</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Spis&#x000e1;k</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name>, <name><surname>N&#x000e9;meth</surname><given-names>AM</given-names></name>, <etal>et al</etal> (<year>2008</year>) <article-title>Inflammation, adenoma and cancer: objective classification of colon biopsy specimens with gene expression signature</article-title>. <source>Dis Markers</source><volume>25</volume>: <fpage>1</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>16</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18776587</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0048547-Galamb2"><label>13</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Galamb</surname><given-names>O</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Sipos</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Solymosi</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Spis&#x000e1;k</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Kren&#x000e1;cs</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name>, <etal>et al</etal> (<year>2008</year>) <article-title>Diagnostic mRNA expression patterns of inflamed, benign, and malignant colorectal biopsy specimen and their correlation with peripheral blood results</article-title>. <source>Cancer Epidemiol Biomarkers Prev</source><volume>17</volume>: <fpage>2835</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>2845</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18843029</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0048547-Galamb3"><label>14</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Galamb</surname><given-names>O</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Spis&#x000e1;k</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Sipos</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name>, <name><surname>T&#x000f3;th</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Solymosi</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name>, <etal>et al</etal> (<year>2010</year>) <article-title>Reversal of gene expression changes in the colorectal normal-adenoma pathway by NS398 selective COX2 inhibitor</article-title>. <source>Br J Cancer</source><volume>102</volume>: <fpage>765</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>773</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">20087348</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0048547-Mikeska1"><label>15</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Mikeska</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Dobrovic</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name> (<year>2009</year>) <article-title>V